HR Analytics Dashboard – Employee Attrition Overview
This project provides insights into employee attrition and workforce trends using Power BI.
The dashboard highlights key HR metrics to help organizations make data-driven decisions.

🔑 Key Insights
Attrition Rate: 14.65%

Average Monthly Income: ₹6.54K

Average Working Years: 7.3

Overtime Analysis: Distribution of employees working overtime vs not

Gender Distribution: Male vs Female ratio

Job Roles: Employee count across roles (Sales Executive, Research Scientist, Laboratory Technician, etc.)

Education Field: Employee distribution by Life Sciences, Medical, Marketing, Technical Degree, and Others

📊 Visualizations
Pie charts for Overtime and Gender

Line chart for Monthly Income by Job Role

Bar chart for Employee Count by Education Field

Table for Employee Count by Job Role and Gender

🚀 Tools Used
Power BI for dashboard creation

Excel/CSV datasets for HR employee data

Data cleaning & transformation using Power Query

🎯 Purpose
This dashboard helps HR teams to:

Identify attrition patterns

Understand workforce demographics

Support strategic HR planning
